{"version":1,"content":"<p>在英偉達前行政總裁黃仁勳突然離職並引發市場震動後，微軟行政總裁薩提亞·納德拉首次公開就此事發表看法。儘管外界對於英偉達未來發展和領導層交接存在擔憂，但納德拉表示，他依然對這家人工智能晶片巨頭及其管理團隊充滿信心。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587030.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T03:12:32.438589+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":111,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T02:52:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T03:05:54.330309+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T03:05:54.330309+00:00","content_hash":"379424540627ad0f37523405840e6fff0862ae4db5896467b7e678530b3e9307","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}